# Long /faction threads that unfold over several minutes: people join late, drift off topic, leave
# for a pull and come back. "~ N" is a lull of N seconds. Arguments are period knowledge in new
# words; place, class and specialization names are checked against the world database.

@kind debate
@realm *

@topic buffbots
@levels 30-50
@scene long_buffbots
@role B type=NoLifer
@role C type=Socialite
@role D type=Leveler
@role E type=Crafter
@role F type=*
A: {q} serious question, is running a buffbot on a second account cheating?
B: cheating how? it is my coin, my account, my time
C: it is a whole person's worth of help that one person controls
B: so? nobody else wanted to group at 4am
D: i tried soloing my 30s without one and it was miserable
C: miserable is how you find a group though
~ 25
B: the buffs make a solo player as strong as a duo, that is the point
C: and that is the problem. why would anyone invite a support class anymore?
E: as a crafter i love buffbots, everyone with one buys two sets of gear
D: lol, true
~ 30
F: wait what did i miss
A: buffbot argument, round three
F: oh. bots are fine in pve, ruin the frontier though
B: everyone in the frontier has buffs anyway
F: from a person who can get mezzed. a bot sits in the back untouchable
C: that is my point exactly. the bot never takes risks
B: the bot sits behind a wall like any careful healer would
~ 40
D: honestly the real fix is more people grouping
C: thank you
B: i group all the time, the bot just covers the empty hours
E: anyone need armor for their bot by the way
A: lol
~ 20
F: so where did we land
C: bots fine for leveling, not in the frontier
B: bots fine everywhere, people just like to complain
D: we landed nowhere, same as always
A: good talk everyone :)

@topic stealthers
@levels 35-50
@scene long_stealth
@role B type=Leveler,Crafter
@role C type=NoLifer
@role D type=Daredevil
@role E type=Socialite
A: third time tonight a stealther got me on the road
B: same. you cannot even see them before the stun lands
C: you are walking alone through the frontier at night, what did you expect
B: i expected to reach the keep
D: honestly i love it, keeps you on your toes
B: easy to say when it is not your bind point you are running from
~ 30
E: you could just ask in faction for a group to travel with
A: i did, nobody answered
C: that is the real lesson. the frontier punishes people alone
B: so leveling players should never set foot out there?
C: they should travel with friends, like everyone else does
~ 35
D: or you buy see-hidden friends. i mean literally, a group with a stealther in it
E: lol stealther escorts
B: so to stop stealthers i need my own stealther
D: yes. welcome to the frontier
~ 25
C: for what it is worth, stealthers die instantly to any real group
B: then why do they never fight real groups
C: because we are not stupid
A: ok that one made me laugh
E: invite me next time you head out, i will come
A: deal, leaving in five

