B: you know what metal bars cost? and how many fail before one comes out right?
C: i could farm a named for a week and still pay less
B: then farm the named. let me know how the stats look
~ 30
E: and do not forget the hours on the skill. every point of skill is coin burned
C: that is your choice though, nobody asked you to craft
E: everybody asked, the moment they wanted armor
~ 25
D: spellcrafting is where the real cost is, gems are not cheap
B: and one overcharge gone wrong eats the profit of three orders
C: so do not overcharge
B: then your stats are worse and you complain about that instead
~ 35
A: is there a cheaper way?
E: buy a plain crafted piece and fill it with drops for the other slots
D: or wait until 50 and do the whole suit once
C: or stop worrying and level
B: or tip your crafter
A: lol ok, what do you charge for a chest piece
B: send me your stats and level, we can talk

